  "locality": "London",
  "reference_no_of_permission_being_relied_on": "This application should be read in the context of previous related applications for Diprose Chapel, which established a staged, conservation-led approach to understanding, repairing and adapting the building.\nApplication ref. 2025/4580 related to investigative and enabling works, including opening-up, removal of later non-historic fabric, local repairs and investigations. These works were intended to understand the building’s construction, condition and causes of deterioration, and to establish an evidential basis for future conservation proposals.\nApplication ref. 2026/0300 related to the dismantling and removal of the non-historic rood screen.\nApplication ref. 2026/0588 related to internal and external repairs and the removal of the non-original rood screen.\nThe present application represents a further related stage in the conservation-led repair and reuse of Diprose Chapel, bringing forward a more developed proposal for its long-term residential adaptation, informed by opening-up works, site investigation, design development and structural engineer’s advice.\n",
